// Census of the vocab tree under scheme census@1 (declared in
// _registry/conventions.kdl): emitted by the importer on every
// run, never hand-edited. concepts counts `concept` declarations;
// inactive/retired count concepts whose own status spells it (all
// others are active by the file default); named/sv/en count
// concepts carrying a name designation (sv/en: with that
// locale). mappings counts `mapping` declarations per collection
// with their effective relationship kind (own relationship, else
// bindings counts omop-binding nodes apart; assessed = carries a
// the collection's projected default). census-tier rows count the
// mappings' confidence tiers: scheme vocabmod-se-confidence@1
// scores 0.87/0.71/else -> H/M/L, scheme
// vocabmod-se-confidence-unassessable@1 -> U; a mapping carrying
// no confidence enters no tier.
census "vocab-tree" version="1" scheme="census@1" {
